  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to increase financial intermediation, financing for rational energy utilisation as well as providing benefits in terms of energy resource utilisation and assisting in mitigating increasing energy prices and high energy intensity in the region; enhance sustainability, financing sustainable energy investments in the region; provide project preparation support and financing to industry, SMEs, agribusiness, residential and commercial services</narrative>
